			"notes": "# V1.0 Release\nThank you for downloading this mod! I've spent a lot of time getting this *simple* mod to work, so it means a lot to me when someone uses it. In this Alpha release, the mod adds in a timer in the top-left corner of the screen, and allows the user to see how long they've been in the game for. \n\n_P.S: There is currently a bug in the mod which makes it so that it starts the timer on launch, and not whenever you join a server or world. This will be patched soon!_"
